PlaneStateMachine

[*] --> Order
Order --> Arrival
Arrival --> Preparation
Preparation --> Operations
Operations --> Maintenance
Maintenance --> Preparation
Preparation --> Service
Service --> Operations
Operations --> NoMoreFlightsOrMaintenanceRequired
NoMoreFlightsOrMaintenanceRequired --> Maintenance
Maintenance --> Preparation
Preparation --> OutOfService
OutOfService --> RemovedFromOperations
RemovedFromOperations --> [*]

@enduml
